    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this point and shoot adventure, you will learn how to throw shuriken and arrows to destroy targets. Dodge obstacles and swing your sword to cut your target in half. With a progressive increase in difficulty, the challenge becomes interesting. Learn to be a ninja and all the skills that this deserves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90 levels with challenges typical of a ninja.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 skills to perfect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 game modes according to your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 night mode to make the most of your ninja vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will test your skills, response time, coordination and aim.</p>",
